{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/sea-cliff-residences-imtiaz-developments-dubai-islands","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1422,"crm_id":"7579","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Sea Cliff Residences","slug":"sea-cliff-residences-imtiaz-developments-dubai-islands","display_address":"Dubai Islands","building_type":["apartment","duplex"],"completion_year":"2028","developer":"Imtiaz Developments","price":1900000,"display_price":"1.9M","lattitude":25.292639381169,"longitude":55.307835971156,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Sea Cliff by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-imtiaz-developments/\">Imtiaz Developments</a> is a premium waterfront residential development located on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubai-islands/\">Dubai Islands</a>. Designed as an ocean-inspired address, Sea Cliff combines contemporary architecture with panoramic sea views. The building features a balanced mid-rise structure that maximizes open views while maintaining privacy and exclusivity within a coastal setting.</p><p>The project comprises 170 residences, including <strong>1 to 3-bedroom apartments and a limited collection of 4-bedroom duplexes.</strong> Select duplex units include private pools, providing an elevated level of privacy. Residents benefit from a comprehensive amenity offering, including a swimming pool, kids' pool, clubhouse, gym, and landscaped seating areas. Positioned within Dubai’s 2040 Urban Master Plan and D33 Economic Agenda framework, the project is located in a dynamic waterfront community directly connected to the mainland via established bridges and major road networks.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_73d7687758.jpg","hash":"Feature_73d7687758","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Hero_image_provident_8af42a940e.jpg","hash":"Hero_image_provident_8af42a940e","name":"Hero image-provident.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_12_0102d614f7.jpg","hash":"Gallery_12_0102d614f7","name":"Gallery-12.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_3_46393a0c78.jpg","hash":"Gallery_3_46393a0c78","name":"Gallery-3.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_4_c0a8b8515c.jpg","hash":"Gallery_4_c0a8b8515c","name":"Gallery-4.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_11_d5f88a62aa.jpg","hash":"Gallery_11_d5f88a62aa","name":"Gallery-11.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_9_8851d1f2d3.jpg","hash":"Gallery_9_8851d1f2d3","name":"Gallery-9.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_13_309b86a27b.jpg","hash":"Gallery_13_309b86a27b","name":"Gallery-13.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_7_a7bba99e06.jpg","hash":"Gallery_7_a7bba99e06","name":"Gallery-7.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_1_f5c4702931.jpg","hash":"Gallery_1_f5c4702931","name":"Gallery-1.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_6_172927a898.jpg","hash":"Gallery_6_172927a898","name":"Gallery-6.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_5_fec481a865.jpg","hash":"Gallery_5_fec481a865","name":"Gallery-5.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_8_6637eae95f.jpg","hash":"Gallery_8_6637eae95f","name":"Gallery-8.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_10_cfd3699e0f.jpg","hash":"Gallery_10_cfd3699e0f","name":"Gallery-10.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_2_54c3b39abf.jpg","hash":"Gallery_2_54c3b39abf","name":"Gallery-2.jpg"}],"images":[],"characteristics_module":{"id":2085,"cta":{"id":2923,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Find out more","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#register-interest"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Selling_Point_092f9977b1.jpg","hash":"Selling_Point_092f9977b1","name":"Selling-Point.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Experience Island Living at its Finest","heading":"Unique Selling Points","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Prime Waterfront Location - Sea Cliff is positioned on the Dubai Islands, a master-planned island destination directly connected to the mainland through established bridges and major road networks.</li><li>Developed by Imtiaz Developments - The project is delivered by Imtiaz Developments, presenting a branded residential offering within a strategically planned island community.</li><li>Limited Inventory - With only 170 residences, Sea Cliff maintains a controlled supply, supporting exclusivity and reducing high-density living compared to large-scale developments.</li><li>Diverse Unit Configuration - The development offers 1 to 3-bedroom apartments and limited 4-bedroom duplexes, appealing to both individual investors and larger households.</li><li>Spacious Layouts - Apartments start from 730 sq. ft., while duplex residences extend up to 4,120 sq. ft., positioning the project in the larger-unit segment of the market.</li><li>40/60 Payment Structure - The payment plan includes 20% on booking and 60% payable on completion in Q1 2028, allowing phased financial commitment.</li><li>State-of-the-Art Amenities - Facilities include a swimming pool, kids pool, clubhouse, gym, outdoor gym, yoga zone, jogging track, sky garden, outdoor cinema, landscaped seating areas, and VIP drop-off.</li><li>Select Units with Private Pools - Select 4-bedroom duplex residences feature private pools, a limited and distinctive feature within the development.</li><li>Located within the Dubai 2040 Urban Master Plan - Sea Cliff sits within the Dubai Islands, a district aligned with Dubai’s 2040 Urban Master Plan and D33 Economic Agenda.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2086,"cta":{"id":2924,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Map_Location_c7fec33cae.jpg","hash":"Map_Location_c7fec33cae","name":"Map-Location.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Be a Part of Dubai’s Next Growth Corridor","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Sea Cliff is located on the Dubai Islands, a master-planned island destination directly connected to the mainland through established bridges and major road networks. The development benefits from proximity to key routes, including Sheikh Zayed Road, Al Khail Road, Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road, Al Khaleej Street, and Al Ain–Dubai Road, ensuring smooth connectivity across the city.</p><ul><li>3 minutes to Dubai Islands Marina</li><li>9 minutes to Dubai Islands Beach</li><li>10 minutes to Dubai Creek</li><li>10 minutes to Gold Souk</li><li>20 minutes to Dubai Mall</li><li>22 minutes to Dubai Frame</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":4854,"url":"","file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/brochure_d859909d7b.pdf","hash":"brochure_d859909d7b","name":"brochure"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},"video_module":{"id":3499,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null